            "review_title": "Review at Quan Hoi Đo",
            "review_text": "Marielle M\n162 contributions\n0\nExcellent cuisine\nMar 2025 • Couples\nHonestly Excellent. We have made them restaurants all the time we have been sailing in this beautiful country, from north to south. We discovered this place by chance as we were heading towards something else and what a good surprise...the setting is very nice. The perfect welcome. The menu is beautiful with food I haven't seen anywhere else. We feasted, delicious cuisine. Very generous and I know what I'm talking about, I like to eat and good things...I'm French and food knows me. A delight. We'll stall on dessert, unfortunately, but that's no longer possible. The restaurant is full and only locals, that's a good sign. True, typical cuisine. Nice discovery.\nTranslated from French\nShow original\nWritten March 21, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
