            "review_title": "Review at Quan Hoi Đo",
            "review_text": "digitalroc\nCalgary, Canada2299 contributions\n0\nTraditional Vietnamese Cuisine\nDec 2019\nMy friend who is Vietnamese found this place and surprised me by taking me here for dinner. We had salad roles and a hot pot which I would not have ordered on my own but both were fantastic. The food was authentic traditional Vietnamese cuisine that was a treat to be part of! If you are in Can Tho, I would recommend you try Quan Hoi Do for an authentic Vietnamese experience.\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 30, 2020",
