            "review_text": "Carla\n2 contributions\n2\nNo service at all\nJun 2019\nWe went there for dinner after reading some good reviews. When we arrived we ordered drinks and got a vietnamnese menu, actually no problem but then the waiter left and didn‘t come back for 30 (!!!!!!) minutes. Firstly we could not understand anything, had no clue what dishes were offered and the waiter with quite good English did not help us. Secondly no one even came to order food and just left us alone in the corner. The vietnamnese guests got food, food, food, even though they came like 15min later. After 30min no one offered to help us or came to take the order so we just paid the drinks and left. Absolutely poor service. Not recommending that restaurant.\nWritten June 11, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-04",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
