            "review_text": "Galleyslave2014\nMt Martha, Australia26 contributions\n0\nHidden Gem\nJun 2016 • Couples\nAfter reading a lot of mixed reviews about restaurants in Can Tho, we liked the review from the first and only reviewer and searched this place out and had a great meal. Nothing is in English, which we like, and we had fun looking at some pictures and what other people were having and pointed at things. \nSpring tools were good and do was a salad of corn with pieces of tasty dried shrimp. We had a soup cooked on the table with some chicken, some kind of meat balls and vegetables, with noodles on the side and a big plate of greens and pumpkin flowers to add. \nIt's a bit out of the way, but that made the adventure more fun and we felt like we'd gotten well and truly off the tourist path.\nRead more\nWritten June 20, 2016",
